# Proposed CODEOWNERS for torchlens
#
# Drafted for review; the live file belongs at .github/CODEOWNERS and is
# installed by the CI owner. One line per top-level package, the maintainer
# from pyproject.toml authors. Add a second handle to a line when a package
# gains a co-maintainer; more specific paths later in the file win.

*                                   @johnmarktaylor91
/pyproject.toml                     @johnmarktaylor91
/test-tiers.json                    @johnmarktaylor91
/.github/                           @johnmarktaylor91
/docs/                              @johnmarktaylor91
